ECorp
Copyright 2026 Shyam Sridhar and ECorp contributors.

ECorp is the user-facing product name. Internal compatibility identifiers may continue to use the
legacy `crony-*`, `CRONY_`, and `X-Crony-*` forms until a versioned migration is released.

This repository is an original greenfield implementation informed by public research into
multi-agent systems and multiplayer collaboration products, including Munder Difflin and Buzz.
The ECorp icon and wordmark are original to this repository. No Mr. Robot production artwork,
official E Corp logo, television-character likenesses, Munder Difflin artwork, or Buzz product
branding is included.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses.
